{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "toolkit-ci-benchmark",
  "title": "Toolkit CI benchmark observations",
  "description": "Generated by scripts/build_ci_dashboard.py from observability/queries/ci-benchmark.json. Evidence and telemetry contracts v1.",
  "tags": [
    "ci",
    "pipeline-toolkit"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "CI observations · source evidence stays authoritative",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Fixed scope: **ci / test**, **YRootLab/OnMaru-backend**. Duration panels show exported histogram snapshot means, not percentiles or three-run comparisons. Outcome/quality/work are gauges; never interpret scrape samples as cumulative run totals. Missing data is unknown. Traces reconstruct observed job windows; workflow wall-clock, queue and critical path are unavailable.\n\nOpen a trace, then the run ID's **Actions run** or **Manifest artifacts** link. The latter opens the run artifact list: choose the persisted evidence whose digest matches `toolkit.ci.manifest.digest`. Export status is consumer-local; see the two visibility-gap panels."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Workflow observed job window — mean",
      "description": "Mean of the exported histogram snapshot, by coverage quality. Observed first-to-last job window, not workflow wall-clock, queue time, critical path or a three-run benchmark.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (quality) (toolkit_ci_workflow_observed_window_seconds_sum{workflow=\"ci\",environment=\"test\"}) / sum by (quality) (toolkit_ci_workflow_observed_window_seconds_count{workflow=\"ci\",environment=\"test\"})",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "No telemetry",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Job duration — mean by catalog job",
      "description": "Available job duration histogram mean. ci_job is a trusted finite catalog; other contains unmapped jobs. Top 20 only; no per-run labels.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (ci_job, quality) (toolkit_ci_job_duration_seconds_sum{workflow=\"ci\",environment=\"test\"}) / sum by (ci_job, quality) (toolkit_ci_job_duration_seconds_count{workflow=\"ci\",environment=\"test\"}))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "No telemetry",
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Module duration — mean by catalog module",
      "description": "Complete module command duration only. Missing modules do not become zero; consult collection quality. Module spans are unavailable in evidence v1.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "local-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "local-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (module, quality) (toolkit_ci_module_duration_seconds_sum{workflow=\"ci\",environment=\"test\"}) / sum by (module, quality) (toolkit_ci_module_duration_seconds_count{workflow=\"ci\",environment=\"test\"}))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto"
        }
